  "Contest Rules": "竞赛规则",
  "To ensure a fair and highly realistic trading environment, the contest will strictly follow the parameters below:": "为确保公平且高度仿真的交易环境，比赛将严格遵循以下参数：",
  "Initial Account Setup": "初始账户设置",
  "Each participant will receive a standard demo account funded with $10,000 in virtual capital. The leverage ratio and Stop-out level will remain aligned with Cui live market standards.": "每位参赛者将获得一个入金 $10,000 虚拟资金的标准模拟账户。杠杆比例与强平水平与 Cui 实盘市场标准保持一致。",
  "Tradable Instruments": "可交易品种",
  "Participants may freely trade all financial products available on the platform, including forex pairs (major and cross pairs), gold (XAU), crude oil (WTI), silver (XAG), and more.": "参赛者可自由交易平台提供的全部金融产品，包括外汇货币对（主流与交叉盘）、黄金（XAU）、原油（WTI）、白银（XAG）等。",
  "Ranking Criteria": "排名规则",
  "The contest will be settled at market close on July 3, 2026, and participants will be ranked strictly by final account net value from highest to lowest.": "比赛将于 2026 年 7 月 3 日收盘时结算，并严格按最终账户净值从高到低排名。",
  "Active Trading Requirements": "活跃交易要求",
  "To prevent passive or lock-in strategies after high-risk betting, participants must satisfy any one of the following conditions before the contest ends in order to qualify for ranking and rewards:": "为防止高风险豪赌后的被动锁仓策略，参赛者须在比赛结束前满足以下任一条件，方可获得排名与奖励资格：",
  "Have trading records on at least 10 different trading days.": "在至少 10 个不同交易日有交易记录。",
  "Reach a cumulative trading volume of at least 3 standard lots.": "累计交易量达到至少 3 标准手。",
  "Note: Accounts that fail to meet the minimum requirements above will be automatically disqualified from the final ranking, and prizes will roll down to the next eligible participant.": "注意：未达到上述最低要求的账户将被自动取消最终排名资格，奖品将顺延至下一位符合条件的参赛者。",
  "Post-Contest Review And Results": "赛后复盘与成绩公布",
  "To ensure fairness and transparency, all top-ranked accounts will go through a standard compliance review process before any prizes or certificates are issued.": "为确保公平与透明，所有排名靠前的账户将在发放任何奖品或证书前经过标准合规审核流程。",
  "Account Audit And Review (July 6-7, 2026)": "账户审核与复核（2026 年 7 月 6-7 日）",
  "The organizing committee will carefully review the winners' trading logs to confirm that all operations strictly complied with the contest rules and that no prohibited trading strategies were used.": "组委会将仔细审查获奖者的交易日志，确认所有操作严格遵守比赛规则，且未使用禁止的交易策略。",
  "Winners Announcement (July 8-15, 2026)": "获奖名单公布（2026 年 7 月 8-15 日）",
  "The final verified official rankings will be published on our official website. At the same time, the organizing committee will contact the winners directly through their registered university email addresses to arrange prize distribution.": "最终核实后的官方排名将在官网公布。同时，组委会将通过获奖者注册的高校邮箱直接联系，安排奖品发放。",
